{"id":"n4-052","title":"Verb ない ことになる (Verb nai koto ni naru)","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Expresses a result; 'end up not', 'it will become that', 'it would mean that'.","longExplanation":"The Verb ない ことになる grammar point is used to express a result or consequence. It translates to 'end up not', 'it will become that', or 'it would mean that' in English. It is formed by using the negative form (ない) of a verb followed by ことになる.","formation":"Verb-negative (ない) + ことになる","examples":[{"jp":"今日彼が来ないことになると、私たちの予定はキャンセルされます。","romaji":"Kyou kare ga konai koto ni naru to, watashitachi no yotei wa kyanseru saremasu.","en":"If he doesn't come today, our plans will be canceled.","words":[{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"たち","vocabId":"1416220","reading":"たち"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"予定","vocabId":"1543240","reading":"よてい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"キャンセル","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"このプロジェクトが進まないことになると、収益が減るでしょう。","romaji":"Kono purojekuto ga susumanai koto ni naru to, shuueki ga heru deshou.","en":"If this project doesn't progress, it would mean that revenue will decrease.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進ま","vocabId":"1365980","reading":"すすむ","baseForm":"進む"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"収益","vocabId":"1330500","reading":"しゅうえき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"減る","vocabId":"1263120","reading":"へる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"彼女は試験に合格しないことになると、卒業が遅れます。","romaji":"Kanojo wa shiken ni goukaku shinai koto ni naru to, sotsugyou ga okuremasu.","en":"If she ends up not passing the exam, her graduation will be delayed.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"卒業","vocabId":"1405890","reading":"そつぎょう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅れ","vocabId":"1422020","reading":"おくれ","baseForm":"遅れる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9]},{"jp":"雨が降ると、ピクニックが行われないことになるでしょう。","romaji":"Ame ga furu to, pikunikku ga okonawarenai koto ni naru deshou.","en":"If it rains, it will become that the picnic doesn't take place.","words":[{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降る","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ピクニック","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"